OL,5,
OL,6,CG1975FPeter Woods presents the final
OL,7,Fedition of News Extra (BBC Two).
OL,8,
OL,9,CG1991FSir Alastair Burnet presents an
OL,10,FITV news programme for the final time.
OL,11,
OL,12,CG2001FAmerican illusionist David
OL,13,FBlaine appears on GMTV, interviewed by
OL,14,Fpresenter Eamonn Holmes. Blaine refuses
OL,15,Fto speak and instead gives Holmes the
OL,16,F'evil eye'. Holmes later cited this
OL,17,Finterview as the most awkward moment of
OL,18,Fhis professional career.
